	)
	(text "CORE: 2 mOhm, 40 mV/A, nominal trip 20 A. AUX18, AUX25 and IO33:\n20 mOhm, 0.4 V/A, nominal trip 2 A. LIMIT = 80 uA x 10 kOhm = 0.8 V;\nItrip = 0.8 V / (20 x Rshunt). Review the core trip against its 8 A converter.\nCurrent RC: 1 kOhm / 10 nF, 10 us; voltage RC: 10k || 10k / 10 nF, 50 us."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 114.02 0)
		(effects
